cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Flourish Atlas, cite the software via this file, and cite the
  underlying dataset and study profile listed under references, as the
  Global Flourishing Study data-use terms require.
type: software
title: Flourish Atlas
abstract: >-
  An interactive explorer for the Global Flourishing Study: survey-weighted
  estimates with design-based confidence intervals across 23 countries and
  territories, Waves 1-2 (2023-2024) plus the midyear survey.
